WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:04.525
Step 3 reads each private endpoint
and the zone it registers in.

2
00:00:04.525 --> 00:00:07.825
The vault's endpoint registers
in the central vault zone.

3
00:00:07.825 --> 00:00:11.450
The blob endpoint registers in
the payroll team's own zone.

4
00:00:11.450 --> 00:00:16.025
And the queue endpoint has no zone group
at all: nothing registers its record.

5
00:00:16.025 --> 00:00:18.150
Step 4 reads the findings.

6
00:00:18.150 --> 00:00:22.241
The blob zone is in the payroll
subscription and not linked to the hub;

7
00:00:22.241 --> 00:00:26.475
the blob endpoint registers there;
the queue endpoint has no zone group;

8
00:00:26.475 --> 00:00:30.350
the storage account has two
endpoints and public access still on.

9
00:00:30.350 --> 00:00:34.837
Then the vault findings, and warnings
for public services with no endpoint.

10
00:00:34.837 --> 00:00:37.610
Step 5 runs this chapter's two tests.
